349 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 250 0 R
/E (A hackathon is a place for collaboration in a short amount of time to create a project, or "hack," that solves a problem. Organizations and companies will put together hackathons to bring people together to work rapidly in a short period of time to implement their ideas or start creating prototypes. These projects can be submitted to the hackathon to compete for awards and prizes, typically on Devpost. Check out all our Axe Hacks Prize Categories here!)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [11 636 0 R 13]
>>
endobj
